{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019Z9iPsM5hToGQrN7yi114S","type":"tool_result","content":"Allows you to manage Neo4j resources. Write operations require --rw.\n\nUsage:\n  neo4j-cli [flags]\n  neo4j-cli [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  admin         Manage Neo4j databases, users, roles, and privileges\n  agent-context Emit a command index (or one command's details) as JSON for AI-agent discovery\n  aura          Allows you to programmatically provision and manage your Aura resources\n  completion    Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\n  config        Manage and view global configuration values\n  credential    Manage and view credential values\n  dataset       Discover example Neo4j datasets\n  desktop       Manage DBMSes under a local Neo4j Desktop 2 install\n  docker        Manage local Neo4j containers via Docker\n  help          Help about any command\n  history       View and manage the local command history log\n  query         Run Cypher, inspect the database schema (:schema), and embed text against a Neo4j database via the Bolt protocol\n  skill         Install agent skills for this CLI into supported AI agents\n  update        Self-update the neo4j-cli binary\n\nFlags:\n      --format string   Format to print console output in, from a choice of [default, json, table, toon]. (agents: prefer toon)\n  -h, --help            help for neo4j-cli\n      --rw              Allow write operations. Auto-applied in interactive terminals; required when running under an agent harness or non-interactive script.\n  -v, --version         version for neo4j-cli\n\nUse \"neo4j-cli [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"460c937e-9b98-47ba-b058-593e083567b2","uuid":"831d9d2d-f75d-430c-9214-4e39531badcc","timestamp":"2026-11-18T09:52:17.345Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"Allows you to manage Neo4j resources. Write operations require --rw.\n\nUsage:\n  neo4j-cli [flags]\n  neo4j-cli [command]\n\nAvailable Commands:\n  admin         Manage Neo4j databases, users, roles, and privileges\n  agent-context Emit a command index (or one command's details) as JSON for AI-agent discovery\n  aura          Allows you to programmatically provision and manage your Aura resources\n  completion    Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell\n  config        Manage and view global configuration values\n  credential    Manage and view credential values\n  dataset       Discover example Neo4j datasets\n  desktop       Manage DBMSes under a local Neo4j Desktop 2 install\n  docker        Manage local Neo4j containers via Docker\n  help          Help about any command\n  history       View and manage the local command history log\n  query         Run Cypher, inspect the database schema (:schema), and embed text against a Neo4j database via the Bolt protocol\n  skill         Install agent skills for this CLI into supported AI agents\n  update        Self-update the neo4j-cli binary\n\nFlags:\n      --format string   Format to print console output in, from a choice of [default, json, table, toon]. (agents: prefer toon)\n  -h, --help            help for neo4j-cli\n      --rw              Allow write operations. Auto-applied in interactive terminals; required when running under an agent harness or non-interactive script.\n  -v, --version         version for neo4j-cli\n\nUse \"neo4j-cli [command] --help\" for more information about a command.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019Z9iPsM5hToGQrN7yi114S","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
